At the moment only

      Chapter x
      Part x         etc.

are supported.

What if you have a language where this scheme is not usable, for example
Chinese or Korean?
Both languages need a prefix and a postfix to the chapter number ---

I therefore suggest additional macros like

      \postchaptername
      \postpartname      etc.

to be included in the standard styles. I think this does not cause any
incompatibilites with existing documents using \chapter etc. without
modifications.


    Werner

